Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseChallengerArrives:
	.string "A challenger has come to face\n"
	.string "the CHAMPION!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseRewardSentToPC:
	.string "It was sent to your PC instead.$"

@ Wally (first challenger)

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWallyIntro:
	.string "WALLY: {PLAYER}{KUN}! You became the\n"
	.string "CHAMPION!\p"
	.string "CELEBI and I trained every day\n"
	.string "to catch up with you.\p"
	.string "This time, I'm challenging the\n"
	.string "CHAMPION! Here we go!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWallyDefeat:
	.string "You're still so far ahead\n"
	.string "of me, {PLAYER}{KUN}…$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWallyReward:
	.string "WALLY: CELEBI and I gave it\n"
	.string "everything we had…\p"
	.string "Here, take this. I found it near\n"
	.string "the old tree of the EMERALD FOREST.\p"
	.string "CELEBI reacts to it… Maybe another\n"
	.string "CELEBI is waiting there!$"

@ Steven (second challenger)

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseStevenIntro:
	.string "STEVEN: Hello, CHAMPION.\p"
	.string "I was the CHAMPION of HOENN\n"
	.string "before WALLACE, you know.\p"
	.string "Let me see how strong the new\n"
	.string "CHAMPION is. Show me everything!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseStevenDefeat:
	.string "Splendid…\n"
	.string "You truly are the CHAMPION.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseStevenReward:
	.string "STEVEN: Take this charm.\p"
	.string "They say it makes shining POKéMON\n"
	.string "appear more often.\p"
	.string "A CHAMPION should see the rarest\n"
	.string "sights this world has to offer.$"

@ Wallace (third challenger)

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWallaceIntro:
	.string "WALLACE: {PLAYER}, my friend.\p"
	.string "I left you this room, but I never\n"
	.string "said I wouldn't come back for it!\p"
	.string "Now, let our elegant battle begin!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWallaceDefeat:
	.string "Magnificent… The title is\n"
	.string "yours, without a doubt.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWallaceReward:
	.string "WALLACE: You've earned this.\p"
	.string "Use it on a POKéMON worthy\n"
	.string "of your talent.$"

@ The other challengers, in random order

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseRoxanneIntro:
	.string "ROXANNE: Hello, CHAMPION!\p"
	.string "I studied every battle you fought.\n"
	.string "Now it's time to put my knowledge\l"
	.string "to the test!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseRoxanneDefeat:
	.string "I see… I still have so much\n"
	.string "to learn.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseRoxanneReward:
	.string "ROXANNE: Thank you for the lesson!\n"
	.string "Please, take this.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseBrawlyIntro:
	.string "BRAWLY: Yo, CHAMPION!\p"
	.string "I rode the biggest wave of my life\n"
	.string "to get here.\p"
	.string "Let's see if you can handle it!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseBrawlyDefeat:
	.string "Whoa… Wiped out again!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseBrawlyReward:
	.string "BRAWLY: That was one wild battle!\n"
	.string "Here, this is for you.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWattsonIntro:
	.string "WATTSON: Wahahahah!\p"
	.string "Even an old man like me feels the\n"
	.string "spark when facing the CHAMPION!\p"
	.string "Let's light it up!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWattsonDefeat:
	.string "Wahahahah!\n"
	.string "I'm all discharged!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWattsonReward:
	.string "WATTSON: Wahahahah! What a shock!\n"
	.string "Take this, youngster!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseFlanneryIntro:
	.string "FLANNERY: CHAMPION!\p"
	.string "My grandfather would be proud\n"
	.string "to see me here!\p"
	.string "I'll show you how hot my POKéMON\n"
	.string "can burn now!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseFlanneryDefeat:
	.string "Oh…\n"
	.string "My flames went out…$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseFlanneryReward:
	.string "FLANNERY: You're too strong!\n"
	.string "Please, take this!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseNormanIntro:
	.string "NORMAN: {PLAYER}… I always knew\n"
	.string "you would go far.\p"
	.string "But as a GYM LEADER, I won't\n"
	.string "hold back. Here I come!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseNormanDefeat:
	.string "You've surpassed me, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "I'm proud of you.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseNormanReward:
	.string "NORMAN: Your mother will be proud\n"
	.string "too. Take this, {PLAYER}.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWinonaIntro:
	.string "WINONA: The sky called me here,\n"
	.string "CHAMPION.\p"
	.string "My POKéMON and I will soar\n"
	.string "above you!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWinonaDefeat:
	.string "We were grounded…$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseWinonaReward:
	.string "WINONA: A beautiful battle.\n"
	.string "Please, accept this.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseTateAndLizaIntro:
	.string "TATE: Hehehe… We knew you'd…\p"
	.string "LIZA: …win the POKéMON LEAGUE!\p"
	.string "TATE: But can you beat…\p"
	.string "LIZA: …the two of us at once?$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseTateAndLizaDefeat:
	.string "TATE: Our combination…\p"
	.string "LIZA: …was beaten!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseTateAndLizaReward:
	.string "TATE: You're so strong…\p"
	.string "LIZA: …please, take this!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseJuanIntro:
	.string "JUAN: Ah, CHAMPION.\p"
	.string "Our battle in SOOTOPOLIS was\n"
	.string "a true work of art.\p"
	.string "Let us create an even more\n"
	.string "beautiful one today!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseJuanDefeat:
	.string "Bravo… Your talent is\n"
	.string "truly dazzling.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseJuanReward:
	.string "JUAN: Please, accept this gift\n"
	.string "from an old artist.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseMaxieIntro:
	.string "MAXIE: So… the child who stopped\n"
	.string "TEAM MAGMA is now the CHAMPION.\p"
	.string "I have studied the land, and I\n"
	.string "have studied you.\p"
	.string "This time, the result will be\n"
	.string "different!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseMaxieDefeat:
	.string "Hmph… Once again,\n"
	.string "you prove me wrong.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseMaxieReward:
	.string "MAXIE: …Take this.\n"
	.string "Consider it my acknowledgment.$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseArchieIntro:
	.string "ARCHIE: Bwahahaha! So you're the\n"
	.string "new CHAMPION!\p"
	.string "The sea taught me a lot since\n"
	.string "we last met.\p"
	.string "Let's see if you can stand\n"
	.string "the tide!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseArchieDefeat:
	.string "Bwahahaha!\n"
	.string "Swept away again!$"

Nabla_Text_TitleDefenseArchieReward:
	.string "ARCHIE: You're a real sea dog!\n"
	.string "Here, take this!$"
